  "ruleText": "He-E 701.20 Releasing Information. Information about the investigation shall be confidential, and shall only be released by BAAS to the parties named in He-E 701.21 below.\n\nSource. #5008, eff 11-27-90, EXPIRED: 11-27-96\n\nNew. #6867, eff 10-9-98; ss by #8727, INTERIM, eff 10-9-06, EXPIRED 4-7-07\n\nNew. #8868, eff 4-19-07; (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for He-E 700) #10179, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13600, eff 3-24-23; ss by #13600, eff 3-24-23 (formerly He-E 701.21)",
